approach is to set the `root_folder_id` directly to the \"Youtube_Automation\" folder ID. Alternatively, distinct remotes can be created, \"youtube:\" for \"Youtube_Automation\" and \"backups:\" for \"All_VM_BackUps\", and removing the global remote. This ensures isolation.\n\n\n"}
